language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Five statements: statement k says that exactly k of the five statements are false. Find which statements are true.
find statements : matrix indexed by [int(1..5)] of bool

branching on [statements]

such that
$ statement k is true exactly when exactly k of the five statements are false
forAll k : int(1..5) . (statements[k] <-> ((sum i : int(1..5) . toInt(!statements[i])) = k))
